        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARCIR19ENTR, Single Cylinder Circulaire Knob with Carre Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circulaire Knob Single Cylinder Entryset with Carre Tall Plate is a timeless classic with style and beauty found in its design. The Single Cylinder Circulaire Knob with Carre Tall Plate Entryset is available in some of the most popular finish colors--both for contemporary themes and traditional ones. It is a single cylinder door lock, which is key operated for security. The Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Circulaire Knob is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/circulaire-knob-with-carre-plate-grandeur-carcir19\"><b>Circulaire Knob with Carre Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Circulaire Knob with Carre Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Circulaire Knob with Carre Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARCIR19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262398\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARCIR19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
